{"ticker":"APH","updated":"2026-10-30T22:34:38Z","profile":{"longName":"Amphenol Corporation","shortName":"Amphenol Corporation","sector":"Technology","industry":"Electronic Components","country":"United States","website":"https://www.amphenol.com","fullTimeEmployees":170000,"marketCap":195551182848,"trailingPE":34.478264,"forwardPE":22.43199,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":5.917383,"pegRatio":0.94,"targetMeanPrice":105.0,"targetHighPrice":122.0,"targetLowPrice":85.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":19,"recommendationKey":"strong_buy","revenueGrowth":0.651,"earningsGrowth":0.629,"grossMargins":0.39209,"operatingMargins":0.29681,"profitMargins":0.17950001,"totalRevenue":33046900736,"beta":1.235,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":89.93,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":59.005,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.73},"summary":"Amphenol Corporation, together with its subsidiaries, designs, manufactures, and markets electrical, electronic, and fiber optic connectors in the United States, China, and internationally. It operates through three segments: Communications Solutions, Harsh Environment Solutions, and Interconnect and Sensor Systems. The company offers connectors and connector systems, including high speed, radio frequency, power, fiber optic and other interconnect products; busbars and power distribution systems; power interconnect products; and other products. It also provides value-add products, such as backplane interconnect systems, cable assemblies and harnesses, and cable management products; and other products comprising flexible and rigid printed circuit boards, hinges, other mechanical, and production related products. In addition, the company offers consumer device, network infrastructure, and other antennas; coaxial, power, and specialty cables; and sensors and sensor-based products. It sells its products through its sales force, independent representatives, and a network of electronics distributors to original equipment manufacturers, electronic manufacturing services companies, original design manufacturers, and service providers in the automotive, commercial aerospace, communications networks, defense, industrial, information technology and data communications, mobile devices mark","summary_zh":"安費諾公司及其子公司在美國、中國和國際上設計、製造和銷售電氣、電子和光纖連接器。它透過三個部門運作：通訊解決方案、惡劣環境解決方案以及互連和感測器系統。該公司提供連接器和連接器系統，包括高速、射頻、電源、光纖和其他互連產品；母線和配電系統；電源互連產品；和其他產品。它還提供增值產品，例如背板互連系統、電纜組件和線束以及電纜管理產品；以及其他產品，包括柔性和剛性印刷電路板、鉸鏈、其他機械和生產相關產品。此外，該公司還提供消費設備、網路基礎設施和其他天線；同軸電纜、電力電纜和特殊電纜；以及感測器和基於感測器的產品。它透過其銷售團隊、獨立代表和電子分銷商網路向汽車、商業航空、通訊網路、國防、工業、資訊技術和數據通訊、行動裝置市場的原始設備製造商、電子製造服務公司、原始設計製造商和服務提供商銷售其產品。","sector_zh":"科技","industry_zh":"電子元件","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-02","o":53.445,"h":54.66,"l":52.725,"c":54.625,"v":13973200},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":54.715,"h":55.365,"l":54.45,"c":55.345,"v":13652600},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":55.55,"h":56.39,"l":55.13,"c":56.375,"v":16291400},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":56.5,"h":56.845,"l":54.34,"c":55.225,"v":24819600},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":55.55,"h":55.985,"l":55.195,"c":55.27,"v":18559400},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":55.45,"h":58.62,"l":55.3,"c":58.395,"v":28191600},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":59.0,"h":60.4,"l":58.325,"c":59.545,"v":37826400},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":59.415,"h":60.115,"l":59.415,"c":59.735,"v":19664000},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":59.515,"h":59.795,"l":58.91,"c":59.34,"v":12717800},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":59.245,"h":60.255,"l":59.115,"c":59.62,"v":12126800},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":59.59,"h":59.91,"l":59.105,"c":59.52,"v":15435000},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":59.555,"h":59.75,"l":58.67,"c":59.205,"v":23917800},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":59.5,"h":61.395,"l":59.44,"c":61.035,"v":24260800},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":61.235,"h":62.195,"l":60.645,"c":61.97,"v":31673000},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":61.5,"h":61.97,"l":60.595,"c":61.845,"v":24414400},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":62.005,"h":63.03,"l":61.925,"c":62.7,"v":24026200},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":62.8,"h":63.0,"l":60.765,"c":61.565,"v":16868200},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":60.55,"h":61.19,"l":59.81,"c":61.165,"v":18009400},{"t":"2025-09-26","o":6