26-10-28","zh":"安費諾公司提供 2026 年第四季和全年獲利指引"},{"title":"Amphenol Corp-Cl A (NYSE:APH) Q3 Earnings Beat and Above-Consensus Guidance","src":"ChartMill","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwAFBVV95cUxOMURkTjhNNUszdHlxRzZHRndZcUFsbnpmcUdHTS1rdHRQMDV0cWx1ZmJrX1BZMXBISEhmbDZjdkFGVUU3SnJWUjF1eTNfUy1hTFpadFVMSkdSZlBkeUdPWVU0Rmh3a3d3UFNsbDBxMFZHRzBNNVBqcGtvUGxncVlQSjZYMkF5QjVnczVyVzRsbTRZakNZUHVha0hGNFl0Rkp4eWhzdHRmbFFWOU13VkdBWjhyY0c4UDF1T1ZlSHRDR18?oc=5","date":"2026-10-28","zh":"安費諾公司-Cl A（NYSE：APH）第三季獲利超出預期並高於市場預期"},{"title":"Amphenol buys defense PCB maker AdvancedPCB in deal-heavy run","src":"Dealroom","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimwFBVV95cUxPRzRLUGtCNkt3WE9kb3l5eHZzc2gzYXhwdGxsVGE0a0pvVlhCTDR3d2swem1tWWdWZ3hvOGxFaDZHQlczMnN1aDJ0Z1RHVGd4QjFrUlZGZVdxWXhiOFZSeTFlYTZpTWRfdlItUEhwa3BkXzQ3bURxWmc0OFJsaWZwYkhoZUh1Q0pIdVg4T2tFOEotTXBMLXd4eEdCVQ?oc=5","date":"2026-10-28","zh":"安費諾斥資收購國防 PCB 製造商 AdvancedPCB"}],"themes":[{"name":"財報","count":6},{"name":"分析師評等","count":3},{"name":"國防/軍工","count":1},{"name":"訂單/合約","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-02-11","period":"2025-12-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/820313/000110465926013549/aph-20251231x10k.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"Amphenol Corporation is one of the world's largest designers, manufacturers and marketers of electrical, electronic and fiber optic connectors and interconnect systems, antennas, sensors and sensor-based products and coaxial, high-speed, fiber optic and specialty cable. The Company estimates, based on recent reports of industry analysts, that worldwide sales of interconnect, value-add cable assembly, antenna, cable and sensor-related products were approximately $500 billion in 2025.","zh":"安費諾公司是全球最大的電氣、電子和光纖連接器及互連系統、天線、感測器和基於感測器的產品以及同軸、高速、光纖和特種電纜的設計商、製造商和行銷商之一。該公司根據產業分析師最近的報告估計，到 2025 年，互連、加值電纜組件、天線、電纜和感測器相關產品的全球銷售額約為 5,000 億美元。"},{"en":"Certain predecessor businesses of the Company were founded in 1932, and the Company was incorporated under the laws of the State of Delaware in 1986. The Company's Class A Common Stock (\"Common Stock\") began trading on the New York Stock Exchange in 1991.","zh":"本公司的某些前身業務成立於 1932 年，公司於 1986 年根據特拉華州法律註冊成立。公司的 A 類普通股（「普通股」）於 1991 年開始在紐約證券交易所交易。"},{"en":"The Company's strategy is to provide our customers with comprehensive design capabilities, a broad selection of products and a high level of quality and service on a worldwide basis, while maintaining continuing programs of productivity improvement and cost control. The Company aligns its businesses into three reportable business segments: (i) Communications Solutions, (ii) Harsh Environment Solutions and (iii) Interconnect and Sensor Systems. This alignment and segment structure reinforces the Company's entrepreneurial culture and enables clear accountability of each of our business unit general managers, while enhancing the scalability of Amphenol's business for the future. The Company has three segment managers who lead their respective reportable business segments, each reporting directly to the Company's Chief Executive Officer. All segment information throughout this Annual Report ","zh":"公司的策略是在全球範圍內為客戶提供全面的設計能力、廣泛的產品選擇以及高水準的品質和服務，同時保持持續的生產力提高和成本控制計劃。該公司將其業務分為三個可報告業務部門：(i) 通訊解決方案、(ii) 惡劣環境解決方案以及 (iii) 互連和感測器系統。這種調整和細分結構強化了公司的創業文化，使我們每個業務部門總經理都有明確的責任，同時增強了安費諾未來業務的可擴展性。該公司擁有三位分部經理，領導各自的可報告業務分部，每位分部經理均直接向公司執行長報告。本年度報告中的所有分部資訊"}],"markets":[{"en":"The Company sells products to customers in a diversified set of end markets. For a discussion of certain risks related to the Company's end markets, refer to the subsection titled \"Risks Related to our End Markets\" included in Part I,","zh":"該公司向多元化終端市場的客戶銷售產品。有關與公司終端市場相關的某些風險的討論，請參閱第一部分中標題為「與我們的終端市場相關的風險」的小節，"}],"customers":[],"competition":[],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Communications Solutions","val":12160600000,"zh":"通訊解決方案部門"},{"name":"Harsh Environment Solutions","val":6001900000,"zh":"惡劣環境解決方案部門"},{"name":"Interconnect & Sensor Systems","val":5216100000,"zh":"互連和感測器系統"}],"total":23094700000},"geo":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Other Foreign Locations","val":11433900000,"zh":"其他國外地點"},{"name":"US","val":7987700000,"zh":"美國"},{"name":"CN","val":3673100000,"zh":"中國"}],"total":23094700000}},"peers":["TEL","AME","CDNS","PWR","ANET"]}}